	network</a></li>
	<li><a href="Creating a chance node.html">Creating a chance
	node (in either Bayesian network or an Influence Diagram)</a></li>
	<li><a href="Creating a decision node.html">Creating a
	Decision node (in an Influence Diagram)</a></li>
	<li><a href="Creating an utility node.html">Creating a Utility
	node (in an Influence Diagram)</a></li>
	<li><a href="Creating links between nodes.html">Creating a
	link between two nodes</a></li>
	<li><a href="Setting node properties.html">Setting node
	properties</a></li>
	<li><a href="Selecting algorithms.html">Selecting algorithms</a></li>
	<li><a href="Setting probability tables.html">Setting
	probability tables</a></li>
	<li><a href="Saving the network.html">Saving the network</a></li>
</ul>
